        "classnamespace": "box",
        "rect": [ 134.0, 164.0, 1647.0, 620.0 ],
        "boxes": [
            {
                "box": {
                    "id": "obj-1",
                    "linecount": 7,
                    "maxclass": "comment",
                    "numinlets": 1,
                    "numoutlets": 0,
                    "patching_rect": [ 20.0, 10.0, 884.0, 100.0 ],
                    "text": "[mUnit.stimulus~ @type <sine|impulse|sweep|noise|silence|file> @freq <Hz> @freq2 <Hz> @amp <0-1> @seed <n> @duration <ms> @file <sound file> @trigger <auto|manual>]\n\nA repeatable test signal. It starts when the suite starts (@trigger auto, default) or on a bang (@trigger manual), at the same moment as an [mUnit.assert~] capture. Types: a sine at @freq, an impulse (one sample of @amp), a linear sweep from @freq to @freq2 over @duration ms, white noise from @seed (the same every run), silence, or a sound file played once. Everything but the file is computed sample by sample from a counter in gen~, so two runs give the same samples. `stop` stops it."
                }
            },
            {
                "box": {
                    "comment": "bang: start; stop",
                    "id": "obj-2",
                    "index": 0,
                    "maxclass": "inlet",
                    "numinlets": 0,
                    "numoutlets": 1,
                    "outlettype": [ "" ],
                    "patching_rect": [ 20.0, 129.0, 30.0, 30.0 ]
                }
            },
            {
                "box": {
                    "comment": "signal",
                    "id": "obj-3",
                    "index": 0,
                    "maxclass": "outlet",
                    "numinlets": 1,
                    "numoutlets": 0,
                    "patching_rect": [ 20.0, 673.0, 30.0, 30.0 ]
                }
            },
            {
                "box": {
                    "id": "obj-4",
                    "maxclass": "newobj",
                    "numinlets": 1,
                    "numoutlets": 2,
                    "outlettype": [ "", "" ],
                    "patching_rect": [ 170.0, 133.0, 547.0, 22.0 ],
                    "text": "patcherargs @type sine @freq 440. @freq2 2000. @amp 1. @seed 1 @duration 1000. @trigger auto"
                }
            },
            {
                "box": {
                    "id": "obj-5",
                    "maxclass": "newobj",
                    "numinlets": 9,
